# Start one named workflow on task_manager. Ids come from the latched
# /task/workflows list (WorkflowList). An empty id runs the node's
# default_workflow parameter. Refused (success=false) when the workflow is
# unknown, its check_ready gate fails (robot / servers not available, grid
# not configured, ...) or another workflow is already running.
string workflow
---
bool success
string message
